[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n4_godric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Abbot Godric at dusk, in the chapter house (night 4, fog). He has ordered the house to fast and doubled the incense again.
# Frail, pious and frightened; drugged hardest, he believes. Telling him about the crypt: he'll send Ranulf down to
# bless it, so the cult hears of it (Suspicion +5).
== start
(The chapter house is thick with smoke. The abbot sits in his blanket, a psalter open on his knees, not reading it.)
Godric: My son. Forgive us, there's no supper tonight. I've ordered the house to fast until it leaves us.
-> topics

== again
(The abbot coughs into his sleeve for a long while.)
Godric: Sit, child. Sit with me a little. I'd rather not be alone in here.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n4_godric_fast] Why have you ordered the fast, Father Abbot? -> fast
* [if not n4_godric_seen] What have you seen, Father Abbot? -> seen
* [if died_crypt_pilgrim] [if not n4_godric_crypt] I saw a bound man killed at the altar in the crypt. -> crypt

== fast [set n4_godric_fast]
Godric: Our Lord said some kinds go out only by prayer and fasting. So we'll pray, and we'll fast.
Godric: And Ranulf will burn twice what he burned. It shall find nothing in this house to feed on.
-> topics

== seen [set n4_godric_seen]
(He looks at the door before he answers.)
Godric: It came again last night, to the foot of my bed, and counted.
Godric: It had a brother's face, I think. I couldn't tell you whose.
Godric: Pray for me, child. I'm too old to be this afraid.
-> topics

# He'll send Ranulf to bless the crypt: the cult hears of it (Suspicion +5).
== crypt [set n4_godric_crypt] [suspicion 5]
(His hand finds his crosier and holds it.)
Godric: Under the saint's own altar? Then it's in the crypt with our saint. God help us.
Godric: I'll have Ranulf go down tonight and bless every stone of it. Ranulf will know what to do.
-> topics

== leave
Godric: Pray, my son. Pray and fast. It can't abide either.
"
